@startuml

title SALESTORM - Inventory Reservation Lifecycle

[*] --> AVAILABLE : Stock Initialized

AVAILABLE --> RESERVED : Inventory Reserved

RESERVED --> PAYMENT_PENDING : Payment Initiated

PAYMENT_PENDING --> CONFIRMED : Payment Successful

PAYMENT_PENDING --> RELEASED : Payment Failed

RESERVED --> EXPIRED : 15-Minute TTL

RELEASED --> AVAILABLE : Stock Restored

EXPIRED --> AVAILABLE : Stock Restored

CONFIRMED --> SOLD : Order Fulfilled

SOLD --> [*]

@enduml
